    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The night sky bathes above The Athenaeum in the velvet darkness. The company of 12 citizens gracing the air. Haven Handsteady (philosopher) is here, tending. Snowflakes float lazily. The world is crisp and hushed under winter.</description>
